  "descriptionAndFAQ": {
    "briefDescription": {
      "text": "Hi! Im Abdul, a Senior Developer and Founder of Dev8X with over 6 years of experience building high-performance digital solutions. I specialize in bridging the gap between complex engineering and beautiful, functional design.  If you need a scalable Webflow CMS Setup, Ill build a structured, easy-to-manage system that lets your team update content without breaking the layout. For those looking for speed and SEO dominance, I develop custom Next.js E-commerce stores that provide a lightning-fast shopping experience and high conversion rates.  Additionally, as your GoHighLevel Expert, I can help you automate your business. From CRM setup to complex funnel logic, I ensure your tech stack works for you, not against you.  Why choose me?  Agency-Level Quality: I bring the expertise of a Founder & CEO to every project. Tech Stack: Expert in React, TypeScript, and Node.js. Proven Impact: Ive helped clients reduce load times by 40% and boost engagement. Let's build something that scales. Message me today to discuss your project!"
    },
    "faqs": {
      "section": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I already have a legacy CRM. Can you build something to replace it?"
          },
          {
            "type": "textarea",
            "text": "Yes! I have extensive experience replacing legacy enterprise software with custom, fast, and modern web applications. We can replicate your current necessary features while adding the automations you’ve been missing."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Will the web app be mobile-friendly?"
          },
          {
            "type": "textarea",
            "text": "Yes. In today’s market, most real estate searches and asset management tasks happen on the go. Your application will be fully responsive and perform flawlessly across all devices—desktops, tablets, and smartphones."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Can you build a dashboard that integrates with my existing data?"
          },
          {
            "type": "textarea",
            "text": "Absolutely. I can develop custom Property Management Dashboards that sync with your existing APIs or legacy databases, giving you a modern, unified interface to manage your assets efficiently."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do you provide the IDX subscription or hosting?"
          },
          {
            "type": "textarea",
            "text": "I handle all the technical implementation, development, and integration. You will need to provide your own IDX Broker or MLS credentials and hosting account, but I am happy to guide you through selecting the best providers for your specific needs."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Can you build custom calculators for mortgage brokers?"
          },
          {
            "type": "textarea",
            "text": "Yes, I can build advanced, interactive tools such as mortgage payment calculators, loan-to-value (LTV) estimators, and property valuation logic tailored to your specific loan products."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
